[gd_scene load_steps=21 format=3]

; A2-R01 林间遗迹 — illustration-aligned, editor-authored terrain.
; Scenic detail is an editable SVG Sprite2D. Every walkable surface below is a
; named StaticBody2D with an editor-visible CollisionShape2D; no terrain is
; created by runtime code. The broken bridge exists only in the illustration.
; Coordinate contract: authored 1792x1200 artwork scaled to a 2240x1500 playable room.
; R01->R04 is a single narrow drop at the waterfall veil (1000,780); all other void falls respawn.

